# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Variable files carry secrets and account IDs. Commit only *.example
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example

# Partial backend config -- account-specific
backend.hcl

# Lock file: DO commit this. Pinned provider hashes = reproducible builds.
!.terraform.lock.hcl

# Local
.env
*.pem
*.key
kubeconfig*
.DS_Store
